message: "If you use MatSAR in your research, software, or publications, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MatSAR"
version: "0.1.0dev"
date-released: 2026-06-03

authors:
  - family-names: "Zhou"
    given-names: "Zhexian"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-8278-1230"

repository-code: "https://github.com/JakoError/MatSAR"
license: "Apache-2.0"

abstract: >
  MatSAR is a C++17 matrix library focused on stable dense matrix operations,
  row-wise matrix construction, element-wise operations, broadcasting, comparison,
  printing, and optional BLAS-backed matrix multiplication.

keywords:
  - C++
  - matrix
  - numerical-computing
  - linear-algebra
  - BLAS
  - OpenBLAS
